-------

Navigational commands
-------------------------

navigate().to(url)
navigate().back()
navigate().forward()
navigate().refresh()

driver.get() --->accepts URL in string format only
driver.navigate().to() --->accepts URL in the string and URL object format.


getWindowHandle()
getWindowHandles()

by using set method we cannot extract multiple elements so this is the reason we are using list method

and in set collection we don't follow indexing method

driver.switchTo().window(windowID)  --> for switching browser windows
